<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-more-cottage-cheese-recipes-to-try-nbsp">More Cottage Cheese Recipes To Try&nbsp;</h2>



<p>It is no secret that cottage cheese is having a moment, and I am here for it. So, don&rsquo;t let any leftover cottage cheese go to waste and try some of my other reader favorites below:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>If you are looking for a high-protein bread alternative, my <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/cottage-cheese-flatbread/">Cottage Cheese Flatbread</a> is a two-ingredient recipe that is gluten-free, low-carb, and has 17 grams of protein per serving.</li>



<li>For a lighter spin on comfort food, try my <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/cottage-cheese-mac-and-cheese/">Cottage Cheese Mac and Cheese</a>. It&rsquo;s creamy with a classic, cozy taste you&rsquo;d accept from mac and cheese, but with 26 grams of protein per serving.</li>



<li>And if you prefer something more portable and just as quick to make, my <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/cottage-cheese-egg-bites/">Egg and Cottage Cheese Bites</a> offer the same flavors in a single-serve, grab-and-go form, making them perfect for meal prep.</li>
</ul>



